## 1. Introduction

The logistics industry has seen dramatic changes over the past few years, with e-commerce growth driving the demand for efficient shipping and last-mile delivery solutions. GLS aims to leverage technology and strategic partnerships to streamline operations and enhance customer experiences. This document outlines our current operations, key partnerships, challenges, and strategic recommendations.

